   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SISF Estonia</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sw Inst Support Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Fonden skall st&#xF6;dja utvecklingen av ett regulj&#xE4;rt samarbete mellan Sverige och Estland genom att den estniska sidan genom fonden f&#xE5;r ett st&#xF6;rre ansvar f&#xF6;r projekthantering. Fonden kan st&#xF6;dja mindre insatser som syftar till implementering av Estlands NPAA.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Swedish Institutional Support Fund is to promote the transition process from development cooperation to regular non-subsidised cooperation between Sweden and Estonia and to serve as a complement to EU supported programmes. The Fund will be used for small technical assistance projects within the framework of the National Programme for the Adoption of the Aquis.</narrative>
  </description>
